V1.5 (2024-08-18)
 - fixed a problem in the 'fixup' tool that could cause the Chocobo racing
   minigame to crash in the US version of the game

V1.4 (2024-08-15)
 - ported to Python 3

V1.3 (2014-05-10)
 - added support for the original Japanese release of the game
 - fixed some text encoding portability issues

V1.2 (2014-04-22)
 - removed the dependency on pycdio
 - fixed a bug with missing padding in the KERNEL.BIN file produced by
   'trans'

V1.1 (2014-04-10)
 - added support for the English, French, and Spanish PAL releases of the
   game
 - added recalculation of sort-by-name table in item menu to 'trans'

V1.0 (2014-03-29)
 - first public release
